WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.229
Integers include positive and negative numbers. On the number line right adds and

00:00:05.229 --> 00:00:06.003
left subtracts.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:13.352
Calculate 9 plus (-4). The answer is 5. On the number line, start at 9 and move -4.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.415
The thermometer during a reading competition reads 0 degrees C and changes by -1

00:00:19.415 --> 00:00:23.885
degrees C. What does it read afterward? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.726
The thermometer during a reading competition reads 0 degrees C and changes by -1

00:00:29.726 --> 00:00:35.470
degrees C. What does it read afterward? The answer is -1. On the number line, start

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:37.265
at 0 and move -1.
